Krita Nova 03 - touch/pen-draggable UI on Android

- KisTouchFriendlyStyle: proxy style widening docker separators and splitter
  handles to 14 dp so they can be grabbed with a finger or stylus (Android).
- KisLongPressEventFilter: never hold back presses on UI drag surfaces
  (main window separators, splitter handles, docker title bars, tab bars,
  toolbars). The filter delayed the press until the pointer moved and turned
  a slow drag into a right click, so dragging the UI did nothing.

